I added support to these models to my llm-gemini plugin, so you can run them like this (using uvx so no need to install anything first):<p><pre><code>  export LLM_GEMINI_KEY=&#x27;...&#x27;
  uvx --isolated --with llm-gemini llm -m gemini-flash-lite-latest &#x27;An epic poem about frogs at war with ducks&#x27;
</code></pre>
